        }
      ],
      "message": "contrib: fix off-by-one in makeseeds.py line length check\n\nparseline() skipped lines with fewer than 11 whitespace-separated\nfields, but it reads sline[11] (the user agent), which requires 12.\nA line with exactly 11 fields therefore passed the check and then\nraised IndexError instead of being skipped, aborting the whole run.\n\n11 is the highest index the function uses, so require 12 fields.",
      "committer": {
